"Unidades de temperatura coñecidas: C (Celsius), F (Fahrenheit), K (Kelvin)."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/engineering.xml line 138
#: xml_doc.cpp:1320
msgid ""
"Supported volume units: l (liter), tsp (teaspoon), tbs (tablespoon), oz "
